{"id":"servidor","lemma":"servidor","pos":"noun","rank":3576,"glosses":["server","yours truly; muggins"],"ipa":"/seɾbiˈdoɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"servidores","feminine":"servidora","femininePlural":"servidoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-servidor.wav","examples":[{"text":"Se cayó el servidor otra vez.","en":"The server is down again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/557808","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to fall","l":"caer"},{"g":"the"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"encore!"]]},{"text":"Tendremos que actualizar nuestros servidores.","en":"We'll have to upgrade our servers.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to update"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null]},{"text":"El servidor está caído y no puedo leer mi correo.","en":"I can't check my mail. The server is down.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534388","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"fallen"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to read"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"mail"}]},{"text":"Nuestro servidor permanecerá fuera de línea el 20 de octubre para un mantenimiento planeado.","en":"Our server will be offline on October 20th for scheduled maintenance.","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us"},null,{"g":"to stay, remain, stand","l":"permanecer"},null,null,null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"October"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"maintenance"},{"g":"planned"}],"phrases":[[3,6,"offline"]]}]}